WEBVTT

00:06:28.143 --> 00:06:30.769
and my own beloved country, Bhutan --

00:06:30.793 --> 00:06:32.959
these people will be directly affected.

00:06:34.932 --> 00:06:36.875
When glaciers melt,

00:06:36.899 --> 00:06:38.816
when there's more rain and less snow,

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:43.117
there will be huge changes
in the way water behaves.

00:06:43.681 --> 00:06:45.437
There will be more extremes:

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.966
more intense rain,
more flash floods, more landslides,

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.928
more glacial lake outburst floods.

00:06:52.952 --> 00:06:57.364
All this will cause
unimaginable destruction

00:06:57.388 --> 00:07:01.959
in a region that already has
some of the poorest people on earth.